       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. UNSUPPORTED.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-PACKED-A PIC 9(7) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-PACKED-B PIC 9(7) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-FLAG     PIC X VALUE 'N'.
